pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 60, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Boubakri 2025 — 研究背景 + 解决方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 110, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 150, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>RISC-V TEE 的开放性带来可定制安全硬件，也带来术语碎片化</li>
        <li>轻量 enclave 复用 PMP/ePMP 和 M-mode monitor，受 region 数量和粒度限制</li>
        <li>更强系统修改 page table walker、cache/memory metadata 或安全 monitor，带来验证成本</li>
        <li>CoVE/AP-TEE 需要 TVM、TSM、ABI、memory ownership 和 attestation 组合</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 360, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$border"
  - elementId: section2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 380, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 420, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>Primitive stack：privilege mode、PMP/ePMP、MMU、H-extension 是底座</li>
        <li>System lineage：Sanctum/Keystone -> Penglai/CURE/SPEAR-V -> CoVE/AP-TEE</li>
        <li>Comparison matrix：Table 1 比较 secure I/O、cache side-channel、validation、SDK</li>
        <li>Open challenges：fragmentation、programming model、standardization、production validation</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 660, 1100, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>来源：Boubakri 2025 p.4 Section 2.2; p.12-p.13 Section 3.7; p.17-p.18 Section 3.14</p>